{"id":573572559,"iid":10889,"project_id":31405822,"title":"[PULSE-3339] Bump Manny to 3.23.0","description":"# CHANGELOG\n\n- [x] Added: [PULSE-3339] The Schedule Builder agent can end its guided flow with an Open Schedule button, which closes the builder and unlocks the project.\n- [ ] Changed:\n- [ ] Fixed:\n- [ ] Removed:\n- [ ] Requirements:\n- [ ] Security:\n\n# MR Checklist\n\n- [x] `CHANGELOG.md` (or `[NOCHANGELOG]`) Check\n- [x] Ticket ID (or `[NOTICKET]`) Check\n- [ ] Designer Review and Approval Check\n- [x] No Commented-out Code Check\n- [x] UnitTest Check (dependency bump only; the 43 webapp test files that import `@planera/manny` pass)\n- [x] Code Dependency Check\n- [x] Protocol Dependency Check\n- [ ] Deployment Verification Check\n- [ ] Loom Check\n\nBump `@planera/manny` from 3.22.0 to 3.23.0 on `develop`. 3.23.0 contains only [manny!347](https://gitlab.com/planera.io/react/manny/-/merge_requests/347) (PULSE-3339), which adds the `ScheduleBuilderFinishButton` widget. This is the webapp step of the rollout described in [chat!1069](https://gitlab.com/planera.io/python/chat/-/merge_requests/1069), which is already merged to chat `develop`.\n\nTicket: [PULSE-3339](https://linear.app/planera/issue/PULSE-3339/give-manny-a-new-complete-builder-button-to-end-the-flow)\n\n- With this bump, every Manny request lists `ScheduleBuilderFinishButton` in `supportedWidgets`. Chat only gives the Schedule Builder agent the `finish_schedule_build` tool when it sees that entry, so the Open Schedule button starts appearing once this is deployed.\n- Chat on `develop` already handles the new entry (checked on `origin/develop`), and an older chat ignores it, so deploy order does not matter.\n- No webapp code changes: `package.json` and `pnpm-lock.yaml` only.\n\n## Testing\n\n- `tsc --noEmit` passes with 3.23.0 installed.\n- The 43 webapp test files that import `@planera/manny` pass (1014 tests).\n- The end to end flow (Schedule Builder session, Open Schedule button, project unlocks) was tested locally earlier with this Manny build linked into the webapp and chat from chat!1069.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)","state":"merged","created_at":"2026-11-23T16:52:00.222Z","updated_at":"2026-11-23T17:50:39.661Z","merge_status":"can_be_merged","approved":true,"approvals_required":1,"approvals_left":0,"require_password_to_approve":false,"approved_by":[{"user":{"id":35018257,"username":"andrewb12","public_email":"","name":"Andrew Boskin","state":"active","locked":false,"avatar_url":"https://gitlab.com/uploads/-/system/user/avatar/35018257/avatar.png?v=1795452431","web_url":"https://gitlab.com/andrewb12"},"approved_at":"2026-11-23T17:01:23.058Z"}],"suggested_approvers":[{"id":8049145,"username":"eriks2","public_email":"","name":"Erik Swenson","state":"active","locked":false,"avatar_url":"https://gitlab.com/uploads/-/system/user/avatar/8049145/avatar.png?v=1795392017","web_url":"https://gitlab.com/eriks2"},{"id":8946594,"username":"mikeg2","public_email":"","name":"Mike Guzewicz","state":"active","locked":false,"avatar_url":"https://gitlab.com/uploads/-/system/user/avatar/8946594/avatar.png?v=1795457744","web_url":"https://gitlab.com/mikeg2"},{"id":9101556,"username":"naveenp_pln","public_email":"","name":"Naveen Puvvula","state":"active","locked":false,"avatar_url":"https://gitlab.com/uploads/-/system/user/avatar/9101556/avatar.png?v=1795457247","web_url":"https://gitlab.com/naveenp_pln"},{"id":10451685,"username":"shahbazs","public_email":"","name":"Shahbaz Shoukat","state":"active","locked":false,"avatar_url":"https://gitlab.com/uploads/-/system/user/avatar/10451685/avatar.png?v=1795439873","web_url":"https://gitlab.com/shahbazs"},{"id":10452173,"username":"tayyabs","public_email":null,"name":"Tayyab Sarwar","state":"active","locked":false,"avatar_url":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/829da4c9e149ae5158b95a25c5185f32a0fe8b37721bb553d726963c0a824dcb?s=80\u0026d=identicon","web_url":"https://gitlab.com/tayyab